  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcPivotGrid .NET: the pivot engine, every aggregate, date grouping, filters, drill-down, format rules, export, the field list, the headless renderer and the WinForms, WPF and Avalonia views. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. Calculated fields, show values as, Top N and layout persistence are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
